\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 Advanced Personalization Layer (Where It Gets Powerful)\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Instead of embedding just the user message, you can:\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	0.	}Maintain a rolling \'93taste profile embedding\'94\
{\listtext	0.	}Update it after each interaction\
{\listtext	0.	}Store liked / rejected products\
{\listtext	0.	}Blend profile embedding + current query embedding\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Example ranking score:\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 \
0.7 * similarity(current_query, product)\
+ 0.3 * similarity(user_profile, product)\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 This creates long-term taste memory.\
Finding: Persistent taste embeddings are more powerful than one-shot conversational similarity.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

